What the C is: a single-file PNG loader (cute_png-style) — [38;5;10mload_png_mem[0m plus a public [38;5;10mcp_inflate[0m DEFLATE decoder and the exported Huffman/length/distance tables. The header has no namespace macros, so linker symbols are the source-level names; [38;5;10mnm[0m confirms the Rust [38;5;10m.so[0m exports exactly the same set ([38;5;10mload_png_mem[0m, [38;5;10mcp_inflate[0m, [38;5;10mcp_error_reason[0m, [38;5;10mcp_fixed_table[0m, [38;5;10mcp_permutation_order[0m, [38;5;10mcp_len_extra_bits[0m, [38;5;10mcp_len_base[0m, [38;5;10mcp_dist_extra_bits[0m, [38;5;10mcp_dist_base[0m).[0m[0m
